<title>USA: Dow drops more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 100 points in late afternoon trading Monday as investors stepped up their profit-taking following the strong recent performance of the blue-chips.</p>
<p>At 3:07 p.m. EDT, the index of 30 blue-chip issues was off 100.87 points at 7,695.64.</p>
